Package: nestwg
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: NestWG contributors <mcrmck@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/mcrmck/nestwg
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/mcrmck/nestwg.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/mcrmck/nestwg
Suggests: wireguard-tools
Description: persistent nested WireGuard VPN chains
 NestWG composes two or more WireGuard tunnels inside Linux network
 namespaces. Applications run in an isolated, fail-closed payload network
 while lifecycle commands manage the chain as one named resource.
